  "solution": "Given that:\n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n**Sign**\n\n \n ÷ \n × \n \n \n\n \n \n**Interchange Sign**\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n1) 24 + 84 ÷ 12 - 16 × 7 = 129\n\nInterchanged sign with given mathematical sign, we get :\n\n= __**24 ÷ 84**__ + 12 × 16 - 7\n\n= 0.285 + __**12 × 16**__ - 7\n\n= __**0.285 + 192**__ - 7\n\n= __**192.285 - 7**__\n\n= 185.285 ≠ 129 (False)\n\n**2) 24 × 84 + 12 ÷ 16 - 7 = 129**\n\n**Interchanged sign with given mathematical sign, we get :**\n\n=** 24 -__ 84 ÷ 12__ + 16 × 7 **\n\n=** 24 - 7 + __16 × 7__**\n\n=** __24__ - 7 __+ 112__**\n\n= __**136 - 7**__\n\n=** 129 = 129 (True)**\n\n3) 24 - 84 ÷ 12 +16 × 7 = 129\n\nInterchanged sign with given mathematical sign, we get \n\n= 24 × 84 + __**12 ÷ 16**__ - 7\n\n= __**24 × 84**__ + 0.75 - 7\n\n= __**2016 + 0.75**__ - 7\n\n= __**2016.75 - 7**__\n\n= 2009.75 ≠ 129 (False)\n\n4) 24 - 84 ÷ 12 × 16 + 7\n\nInterchanged sign with given mathematical sign, we get \n\n= 24 × 84 + 12 - __**16 ÷ 7**__\n\n= __**24 × 84**__ + 12 - 2.285\n\n= __**2016 + 12**__ - 2.285\n\n= __**2028 - 2.285**__\n\n= 2025.715 ≠ 129 (False)\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 2\". **",
